3	/**
4	 * Derives an owner's numeric membership level, assigned at creation.
5	 *
6	 * <p>Starts at 1; add 1 when an email is present; add 1 when {@code namesakeCount}
7	 * is 0; capped at 3. Level 4 is reserved for tenure.
