9	 * same firstName and lastName as the new owner, compared case-insensitively. Runs after
10	 * {@link BuildOwner} and before {@link SaveOwner}, so the count reflects the owners that
11	 * existed before this create and excludes the one being created. The value is fixed at
12	 * creation time and persisted with the owner.
